validator_rules[10]{pk,rule_name,section_pk,severity,summary}:
  1,Reject v1/v2 headers,5,critical,Header versions 1 and 2 are rejected outright
  2,Enforce nested lupopedia.headers mapping,5,critical,All header fields must be children of lupopedia.headers; flat headers rejected
  3,Enforce exact key set and order,5,critical,19 keys in section 4.2 order; no extra keys; reject unknown keys
  4,No multi-line or array values,5,critical,"Each key:value occupies one line; YAML arrays forbidden"
  5,Validate trust_tier enum,5,critical,trust_tier must be seed|canonical|staging|archive
  6,Validate memory_toon path and existence,5,high,memory_toon must follow path pattern and target file must exist
  7,Validate channel_key required,5,critical,channel_key must be non-empty string
  8,Validate thread_id per artifact_type,5,high,discussion requires non-empty thread_id; prd requires ''
  9,Validate sidecar identity alignment,5,critical,"file_path_from_root, channel_key, trust_tier, dialog_transcript must match header"
  10,Validate author.type and verified_by.type,5,high,Must be actor|user|system (no 'agent' type)

