definitions[5]{pk,meaning,term}:
  1,Token-Oriented Object Notation optimized for LLM parsing and token efficiency (50-60% reduction vs JSON),TOON
  2,"JSON sidecar file containing rich metadata (tags, edges, footer, init) not stored in YAML header",header_metadata
  3,"Logical DB lookup slug; not a filesystem path; format: {federation_node_id}/{channel_key}/{thread_slug}",dialog_transcript
  4,"Path to primary .toon export; follows pattern lupo-memory/{channel_key}/{trust_tier}/{memory_year}/{MM}/{slug}.toon; memory_toon connects the artifact to its canonical memory representation",memory_toon
  5,"Documentation/export classification: seed (immutable), canonical (verified), staging (WIP), archive (deprecated)",trust_tier
